{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17214280","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17214280","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1721428001:0":{"text":"실례합니다, 부인. 혹시 2층에 사는 여자애를 보신 적이 있나요?","source_cn":"打扰了。女士，请问您见过住在二楼的那户小姐吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x473D3E9180E33A59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721428002:0":{"text":"그 마른 여자애 말이니?","source_cn":"你说那个很瘦的小姑娘？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F89374CB249612C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721428003:0":{"text":"어디 갔는지 모르겠네. 우리 같은 “서민”들이랑은 말도 안 섞고 눈도 안 마주쳐.","source_cn":"不知道哪去了。她不爱跟我们这群“贫民”聊天，看都不看我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E79CAA5C4B61EB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721428004:0":{"text":"그럼 그 애가 마지막으로 외출한 게 언제인지 아세요?","source_cn":"您知道她最后一次出门是什么时候吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBECEF5E225230CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721428005:0":{"text":"내가 그걸 어떻게 아니? 가깝게 지내지도 않는데!","source_cn":"我哪知道？我和她又不熟！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A3543A583C1F523","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":